# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AutoFinDocs — Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite (default — used when Supabase is NOT configured)
DATABASE_URL="file:/home/z/my-project/db/custom.db"

# ─── Supabase (optional — set BOTH to switch from SQLite → Supabase) ────────
# When SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are set, the app uses Supabase
# (PostgreSQL via PostgREST) instead of local SQLite. Run supabase-schema.sql
# in the Supabase SQL editor first.
SUPABASE_URL=""
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""
# Optional: service role key for admin operations (bypasses RLS)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""

# ─── OCR Provider ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Which vision model reads your documents:
#   "gemini" → Google Gemini 2.5 Flash (requires GEMINI_API_KEY)
#   "zai"    → Z.ai GLM-4.6V vision (default, no key needed in this env)
OCR_PROVIDER="gemini"

# ─── Google Gemini (for OCR) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
# Flash model — options: gemini-2.5-flash, gemini-2.0-flash, gemini-1.5-flash
GEMINI_MODEL="gemini-2.5-flash"

# ─── App ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV="development"
